      "text": "Doctor, I'm just here to help with the details."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.89,
      "end_seconds": 22.44,
      "duration_seconds": 7.55,
      "text": "Of course please stay. It's helpful to have you here. What would you like to start with today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.44,
      "end_seconds": 27.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "It's spots on my face, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.58,
      "end_seconds": 31.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.4,
      "end_seconds": 50.29,
      "duration_seconds": 16.89,
      "text": "Moderate, I'd say. So, I've also had spots on my back, for about three months. Erm, and I've been feeling low about my skin as well, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.49,
      "end_seconds": 66.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 68.52,
      "end_seconds": 72.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "she takes escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.65,
      "end_seconds": 76.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "and for how long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 77.21,
      "end_seconds": 79.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "About nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.78,
      "end_seconds": 83.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.82,
      "end_seconds": 88.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.71,
      "end_seconds": 92.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "what do you do during the the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.17,
      "end_seconds": 98.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.51,
      "end_seconds": 104.81,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.93,
      "end_seconds": 117.22,
      "duration_seconds": 7.29,
      "text": "years back I got itching from trimethoprim, so I stay away from it now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.81,
      "end_seconds": 121.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.01,
      "end_seconds": 135.22,
      "duration_seconds": 12.21,
      "text": "I've had anxiety yes. My neighbour said I should get it it looked at. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.96,
      "end_seconds": 138.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "how about irregular periods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.7,
      "end_seconds": 141.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "no. No irregular periods"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.44,
      "end_seconds": 146.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Any being pregnant excess hair growth headaches or joint pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.37,
      "end_seconds": 155.75,
      "duration_seconds": 7.38,
      "text": "I haven't had being pregnant, excess hair growth, headaches or joint pain, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.23,
      "end_seconds": 159.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.95,
      "end_seconds": 162.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "no, nothing there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.46,
      "end_seconds": 179.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.64,
      "end_seconds": 191.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "sit still for a moment.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.72,
      "end_seconds": 222.75,
      "duration_seconds": 9.03,
      "text": "okay: oxygen saturation is 97 percent, BP is 119 over 71, temperature is 36.4 degrees, pulse 76."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.1,
      "end_seconds": 226.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.51,
      "end_seconds": 228.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.96,
      "end_seconds": 247.0,
      "duration_seconds": 7.04,
      "text": "There are red inflamed lumps and blackheads over both cheeks and the forehead, and a few scars."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.49,
      "end_seconds": 262.0,
      "duration_seconds": 9.51,
      "text": "right, thank you, you can get dressed. Okay, so my impression is this: The most likely explanation is moderate inflammatory acne"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.1,
      "end_seconds": 285.31,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "I think blood tests makes sense here, for acne treatment baseline"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.39,
      "end_seconds": 289.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "where would I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.69,
      "end_seconds": 320.75,
      "duration_seconds": 30.06,
      "text": "you'll be taking adapalene gel 0.1 percent once a night for twelve weeks. That should help with acne. Use sunscreen daily and the gel can sting for the first couple of weeks. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids two to three litres a day if you can and get proper rest. The dermatology clinic would be the right next step I'll refer you. Please come and see me in twelve weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.6,
      "end_seconds": 327.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.45,
      "end_seconds": 332.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "right I'll do that. Thank you doctor"
